===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Tending to [[intrude]]; doing that which is not [[welcome]]; [[interrupting]] or [[disturbing]]; [[enter]]ing without [[permission]] or [[welcome]].
#: {{ux|en|Did it ever cross your mind that he might find all those questions you ask '''intrusive'''?}}
# {{lb|en|geology}} Of rocks: forced, while in a [[plastic]] or molten state, into the cavities or between the cracks or layers of other rocks.
# {{lb|en|linguistics}} [[epenthetic]]

